COMMAND DISCOVERY
Every action lists its exact noninteractive CLI equivalent. Enter opens the guided form; esc closes.
/backup

> Create resource backup       b   backup.create
    cli: eregion platform submit --kind platform.backup.create --target node/<host> --input-file
    action.json --idempotency-key <key> --json
  Verify backup archive        v   backup.verify
    cli: eregion platform submit --kind platform.backup.verify --target node/<host> --input-file
    action.json --idempotency-key <key> --json
  Restore verified backup      R   backup.restore · destructive
    cli: eregion platform submit --kind platform.backup.restore --target node/<host> --input-file
    action.json --idempotency-key <key> --json
j/k move · type filter · enter open · esc close



















